flowchart LR
    U[User prompt] --> CA[coding-agent]
    CA --> A[agent: runLoop]
    A --> AI[ai: streamFunction]
    AI --> RM[Remote model service]
    RM -->|Direct answer| A
    RM -->|toolCall: read| A
    A --> RT[Local read tool]
    RT --> TR[toolResult]
    TR --> A
    A -->|Next model request| AI
    A --> CA
    CA --> U
